OL,3,GNEWSATwo-week half terms: The school
OL,4,Aholiday no one can agree on
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamantha Buckland is bracing herself
OL,7,Ffor a tough fortnight. The single mum
OL,8,Flives in Reigate, Surrey, and her
OL,9,Fseven-year-old son goes to a state
OL,10,Fschool that has just introduced a
OL,11,Ftwo-week half term.
OL,13,FBuckland, 45, has two jobs: teaching
OL,14,Fmedical students at a hospital in
OL,15,FBrighton and working at a vintage shop
OL,16,Fin her home town. The 45-year-old
OL,17,Freceives universal credit and is
OL,18,Fworried about the cost of looking after
OL,19,Fher son while school is closed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
