OL,3,GNEWSATwo-week half terms: The school
OL,4,Aholiday no one can agree on
OL,5,
OL,6,F"What I'm trying to do is find out who
OL,7,FI can get childcare from and work
OL,8,Faround that," she says. "I'd like to
OL,9,Fwork, I need money. It's not cheap to
OL,10,Flive these days."
OL,12,FBut money isn't Buckland's only
OL,13,Fconcern. She's also trying to piece
OL,14,Ftogether the patchwork of childcare
OL,15,Fneeded to cover the break.
